    This program is free software: you can do anything with it.
    It is provided "as is" without warranty of any kind.

    For those who prefer verbosity, this program is licensed under
    the GNU(ish) Annotation Document for Non-assertion License,
    version 1.0 or (at your option) any later version.

    You should have received a copy of GADNAL along with this program.
    If not, it doesn't matter, because you can do anything anyway.

  Alternatively, you may simply write:

    EVERYONE CAN DO ANYTHING WITH THIS WORK.
    ANY USE IS AT YOUR OWN RISK, IT'S AS IS.

  These twenty words have the same legal effect as the preceding
document. We leave it to you to decide which version better suits
